@startuml proposal-new-starts
' cumin works - PROPOSAL: the state of cumin itself for new starts (quota). Q1 to Q4 of issue-states.md
' are transitions of this machine, not of an issue.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.

hide empty description

state "starting new work" as Starting
Starting : do / start ready issues when a slot is free

state "new starts stopped" as Stopped
Stopped : do / finish the runs that go on, start nothing new

[*] --> Starting
Starting --> Stopped : [a quota window is at its limit]\n/ notify the Owner (Q1)
Stopped --> Starting : the Owner allows the 5h window\n[weekly window under its limit] (Q2)
Stopped --> Starting : [the time of the next try passed,\nboth windows under their limit] (Q3)

note "In both states: [nothing can go on without the Owner,\nno agent runs] / tell the Owner once that cumin waits (Q4)." as Q4

legend right
  PROPOSAL. This machine has one instance for one cumin, not one for each issue.
  It lives on the Host (the latest quota reading), not on GitHub.
endlegend

@enduml
